// Title: Port Forwarding Activity Via SSH.EXE
// Rule ID: 327f48c1-a6db-4eb8-875a-f6981f1b0183
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1572, attack.t1021.001, attack.t1021.004
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_ssh_port_forward.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
